Package: variancedonuts
Title: Square-Donut Pictures of the Variance
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Eugene D.", "Hahn", , "maintainer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Draws the identity sum(x^2) = n * mean^2 + sum((x - mean)^2)
    as a square donut: the whole donut is the sum of squared values, the
    hole comes from the mean, and the dough is the sum of squared
    deviations. Includes side-by-side comparisons drawn to one scale and a
    silent check for the numerical boundary where the shortcut formula
    loses accuracy.
